{"seq":1,"slug":"referral-fraud-risk-control-model","title":"推荐反作弊与风控识别模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/fraud-abuse-measurement-scale/referral-fraud-risk-control-model","wordCount":3031,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"推荐反作弊与风控识别模型\">推荐反作弊与风控识别模型</h1><p>推荐活动的增长曲线和作弊曲线几乎同时起跑。一个上线首月带来 3 万新客的 MGM 活动，同期往往也带来数千个由同一批人注册的「新客」——他们共享设备、收货地址与支付工具，唯一区别是每次注册换一个邮箱。本文讨论的是：<strong>如何在这批人不产生真实增量之前，用信号把它们从真用户里分出来，并让处置既能止损又不误伤。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-推荐裂变的五类攻击面\">核心概念：推荐裂变的五类攻击面</h2><p>推荐反作弊之所以比普通支付风控更难，是因为攻击者不需要偷钱——他只需要让系统<strong>多记一笔奖励</strong>。奖励一旦计入台账，后续的核销、打款、冲回都要付出成本。把攻击面拆开，可以看到五类反复出现的模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>攻击手法</th>\n<th>可观测信号</th>\n<th>损失面</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自荐 self-referral</td>\n<td>用小号走自己的码</td>\n<td>设备指纹、支付工具、收货地址重合</td>\n<td>双边奖励被同一人领取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账号农场 farming</td>\n<td>批量注册「被邀请人」领新人奖</td>\n<td>注册时间聚集、邮箱/号码同号段</td>\n<td>新人券成本 + 库存被薅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>串谋环 collusion ring</td>\n<td>真人互相推荐成闭合环</td>\n<td>关系图连通分量呈环状/高密度</td>\n<td>奖励环内循环，零真实新增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>码泄露 code leakage</td>\n<td>把码挂到返利/聚合站</td>\n<td>单一码来源 IP 极分散且高转化</td>\n<td>站外分成侵蚀真实 CAC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账号接管转介 ATO</td>\n<td>盗号后以受害者身份发出推荐</td>\n<td>登录设备/地区突变、行为异常</td>\n<td>奖励被骗，品牌与合规风险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表里最容易被低估的是<strong>串谋环</strong>。前四类是「一对多」或「批量」形态，规则引擎靠计数即可发现；串谋环是「多对多」，每一笔单独看都合法——A 推荐 B 合理，B 推荐 A 也合理——只有把整个关系图拉出来才能看见它是闭合环而非增长。一个 20 人的环每人发展 5 个下线，不用图算法要等第 100 笔奖励才察觉。</p>\n<p>合规约束决定了识别模型的下限：美国 <strong>FTC「消费者评论与推荐意见规则」（16 CFR Part 465，2024 年 8 月发布、60 天后生效）</strong> 禁止以给出特定情绪的评论为条件提供补偿，也禁止买卖虚假社媒影响力指标（<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/news/press-releases/2024/08/federal-trade-commission-announces-final-rule-banning-fake-reviews-testimonials\">ftc.gov</a>）；苹果 <strong>App Store 审核指南</strong>将「操纵推荐」与操纵榜单、搜索并列为不允许（<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/app-store/review/guidelines/\">developer.apple.com</a>）。反作弊因而是维持分发渠道资格的必要动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信号层-设备-身份-行为-关系四类证据\">信号层：设备、身份、行为、关系四类证据</h2><p>反作弊系统的输入不是「谁作弊」的标签，而是四类互相独立的证据源。分层的好处是：任何一层失效（比如设备指纹被绕过），其余三层仍能给出可用的判定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  U[注册/激活事件] --&gt; L1[设备层&lt;br/&gt;指纹/机型/传感器]&#10;  U --&gt; L2[身份层&lt;br/&gt;邮箱/手机/支付/地址]&#10;  U --&gt; L3[行为层&lt;br/&gt;72h 动作序列]&#10;  L1 --&gt; G[实体图&lt;br/&gt;节点=账号/设备/支付/地址]&#10;  L2 --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; CC[连通分量分析&lt;br/&gt;农场与串谋环]&#10;  L1 --&gt; F[特征工程&lt;br/&gt;速度/聚集/熵]&#10;  L2 --&gt; F&#10;  L3 --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; M[风险评分&lt;br/&gt;规则+图+行为]&#10;  CC --&gt; M&#10;  M --&gt; D{风险判决}&#10;  D --&gt;|低危| A1[实时到账]&#10;  D --&gt;|中危| A2[延迟至资格验证]&#10;  D --&gt;|高危| A3[冻结+复核]&#10;  D --&gt;|确证| A4[撤销+追回+名单]\">flowchart TD\n  U[注册/激活事件] --&gt; L1[设备层&lt;br/&gt;指纹/机型/传感器]\n  U --&gt; L2[身份层&lt;br/&gt;邮箱/手机/支付/地址]\n  U --&gt; L3[行为层&lt;br/&gt;72h 动作序列]\n  L1 --&gt; G[实体图&lt;br/&gt;节点=账号/设备/支付/地址]\n  L2 --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; CC[连通分量分析&lt;br/&gt;农场与串谋环]\n  L1 --&gt; F[特征工程&lt;br/&gt;速度/聚集/熵]\n  L2 --&gt; F\n  L3 --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; M[风险评分&lt;br/&gt;规则+图+行为]\n  CC --&gt; M\n  M --&gt; D{风险判决}\n  D --&gt;|低危| A1[实时到账]\n  D --&gt;|中危| A2[延迟至资格验证]\n  D --&gt;|高危| A3[冻结+复核]\n  D --&gt;|确证| A4[撤销+追回+名单]</pre><p><strong>设备层</strong>捕获「同一物理终端」。现代设备指纹不依赖单一 ID，而组合 UA、屏幕、时区、字体、Canvas/WebGL 渲染哈希、传感器噪声等上百维，供应商侧已做到跨设备稳定关联（Incognia 宣称设备智能识别准确率 99.9%，<a href=\"https://www.incognia.com/solutions/referral-fraud\">incognia.com</a>）。跨境要多一层：模拟器、云手机、已 root/越狱设备本身不是作弊证据，但它们是农场规模化生产的典型基础设施，因此作为<strong>加权特征</strong>而非硬性拒绝条件。</p>\n<p><strong>身份层</strong>关注「同一经济主体」。跨境难点是身份锚点不统一：北美看邮箱+卡 BIN，东南亚看手机号+钱包，欧洲受 GDPR 与 PSD2 约束不能随意采集。做法是把可采集锚点<strong>规范化 + 哈希</strong>后入图，只保留关联能力、不保留原始值。</p>\n<p><strong>行为层</strong>最难伪造。真实新客注册后会有探索行为：浏览商品、加购、比价、看物流；农场账号往往领完券即静默。以「注册后 72 小时内的会话数、页面深度、停留时长分布」为特征，能有效区分真人冷启动与机器批量注册。</p>\n<p><strong>关系层</strong>把前三层从「点」升级为「图」：共用设备、支付工具、收货地址各是一条边。当某连通分量的节点数远超正常推荐树规模时，它大概率是农场或串谋环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从信号到分数-规则-图特征与评分融合\">从信号到分数：规则、图特征与评分融合</h2><p>把四层信号变成处置动作，需要一个可解释、可调参、可回滚的打分器。纯规则会陷入「规则越加越多、误伤越来越大」的泥潭，纯模型又缺乏业务可解释性——风控团队需要能回答「这个用户为什么被拦」。主流做法是<strong>规则与模型分层融合</strong>：目标不是抓住所有作弊者，而是让<strong>作弊的边际成本高于边际收益</strong>，同时把真实用户的摩擦控制在感知阈值以下。</p>\n<p>第一层是<strong>硬规则（hard rules）</strong>，拦截确定性作弊，误伤代价必须接近零：同一设备在滑动窗口内关联的注册账号数超阈值；邀请人与被邀请人的支付工具、收货地址、设备指纹三者同时重合；注册时间落在异常聚集窗口（同一 IP 段 10 分钟内注册量超过人类可达速率）。</p>\n<p>第二层是<strong>速度与聚集度特征</strong>。给定滑动窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 与实体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>，关联速率及其标准分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_e(T) = N_e(T)/T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_e = (v_e - \\mu_T)/\\sigma_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_e(T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是窗口内与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 关联的事件数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_T,\\sigma_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是全站均值与标准差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 超阈值即触发复核。其变体是<strong>熵值</strong>：一个推荐码若被大量分散 IP 使用，其来源 IP 的香农熵趋近最大值，这正是码泄露到聚合站的指纹。</p>\n<p>第三层是<strong>图特征</strong>。对每个账号所在的连通分量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，图密度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_C = 2|E_C| / (|V_C|(|V_C|-1))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>、环数与入度分布偏度构成组合特征：高密度 + 多环 + 入度偏斜指向串谋环。真实推荐树是面向下的森林结构（密度低、无环），串谋环是有向图里的强连通分量。</p>\n<p>第四层把它们送进评分模型。梯度提升树或逻辑回归给出可解释分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\sigma(b + \\sum_i w_i x_i + \\sum_j w_j g_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma(z)=1/(1+e^{-z})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是点特征（速度、熵、设备风险等级），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是图特征（密度、环数、分量规模）。分数落地为判决：低危放行、中危延迟、高危冻结、确证撤销。</p>\n<p>延迟处置是这里最重要的一条设计。<strong>奖励延迟到「资格动作验证完成」后再发放</strong>，比事后追回便宜一个数量级——追回要动台账与支付通道，还可能触发客诉与合规争议（参见 <a href=\"../reward-ledger-fulfillment-operations/reward-ledger-accounting-model\">奖励台账与账务记账模型</a> 中反向分录的处理）。把风控前移到「发之前」，是推荐反作弊与支付反欺诈最大的工程差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量-如何判断模型在止损而不是在自嗨\">度量：如何判断模型在止损而不是在自嗨</h2><p>反作弊模型最危险的失效模式不是漏判，而是被<strong>自己的指标</strong>骗了。拦截率高不等于有效——如果拦的全是真用户，拦得越多死得越快。度量须同时覆盖模型质量、业务代价与对抗强度。</p>\n<p>第一组是<strong>分类质量</strong>。作弊标签稀缺，纯监督指标很难算准，通常用弱标签 + 人工抽检估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Precision</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Precision}=\\frac{TP}{TP+FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Precision</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2757em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Recall</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Recall}=\\frac{TP}{TP+FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recall</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2757em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与其调和平均 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>第二组是<strong>业务代价函数</strong>，把两类错误换成钱，才可能选出正确的工作点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>FN</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>fraud</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>FP</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>user</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{cost}] = \\text{FN}\\cdot L_{\\text{fraud}} + \\text{FP}\\cdot C_{\\text{user}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FN</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fraud</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">user</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>fraud</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{fraud}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fraud</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单笔漏判的平均损失（奖励面值 + 后续薅取），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>user</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{user}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">user</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单次误伤的期望成本（客诉、流失、品牌）。跨境场景里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>user</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{user}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">user</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 往往被低估：被误封的邀请人会因社交曝光放大损失。<strong>假阳性成本高的市场要把工作点往保守侧移</strong>，宁可延迟发放也不要直接拒绝。</p>\n<p>第三组是<strong>对抗性指标</strong>，衡量攻击者的成本而非你的收益：作弊者绕过系统所需的资源（新设备成本、改机工具、真人众包单价）越高，防御越有效，定期用红队演练重放历史攻击手法、观察绕过成本漂移，比盯着拦截率更能反映真实态势。攻击者会在上线后 2–4 周内找到新路径：今天拦住模拟器，明天他用真机群控；今天拦住同设备多注册，明天他每号一机。因此模型需要两条迭代回路：<strong>规则版本化回滚</strong>（新规则上线前必须能在灰度中回滚，避免一次误配置拦住全部真实流量）与<strong>指标漂移监控</strong>（拦截率、误伤率、申诉率的周环比，任一项突变即触发复核）。这与 <a href=\"../referral-code-attribution-lifecycle/attribution-identity-stitching-mechanism\">归因与身份拼接机制</a> 共用同一套数据底座：身份拼接质量决定图特征的上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处置梯度与名单运营\">处置梯度与名单运营</h2><p>判决只有落到动作上才有价值。推荐反作弊的处置不是「拦或不拦」的二值选择，而是一组按置信度排列的梯度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>置信度</th>\n<th>处置动作</th>\n<th>可逆性</th>\n<th>关键约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>实时放行，仅记录特征</td>\n<td>无需</td>\n<td>保留全量特征供回溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>奖励延迟至资格动作验证（首单完成/签收）</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>说明延迟原因，避免体验断裂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>冻结双边奖励，进入人工复核队列</td>\n<td>人工</td>\n<td>复核 SLA 与申诉入口必须存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确证</td>\n<td>撤销推荐关系 + 台账反向分录 + 名单</td>\n<td>受限</td>\n<td>留存证据链，应对合规质询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>处置里有两个跨境特有的约束。其一是<strong>隐私</strong>：设备指纹与关系图属于个人数据，GDPR、巴西 LGPD 下需要合法处理基础与最小化采集，NIST <strong>SP 800-63-4</strong> 也要求身份服务把「潜在欺诈指标」纳入隐私风险评估并评估其有效性（<a href=\"https://pages.nist.gov/800-63-4/sp800-63b.html\">pages.nist.gov</a>）。实践做法是把指纹做<strong>单向哈希 + 盐</strong>后入图，只保留「相同/不同」的关联判断能力。其二是<strong>申诉与被遗忘权</strong>：被误判的用户有权要求复核，被确证的名单要设定保留期限并到期清理。</p>\n<p>名单运营是收尾动作。硬黑名单（设备/支付/地址级）用于确证团伙；软名单（特征相似但证据不足）只用于<strong>提升后续事件的风险分</strong>，不直接拒绝。名单必须<strong>有生命周期</strong>：设备会换主、地址会转租、支付工具会易手，永久名单会在两年内积成误伤源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>攻击面有五类：自荐、账号农场、<strong>串谋环</strong>、码泄露、账号接管转介；串谋环只能靠关系图识别，逐笔审核看不出来。</li>\n<li>输入是设备、身份、行为、关系四层独立证据，任一层被绕过其余三层仍可用；打分走「硬规则 → 速度/熵 → 图特征 → 融合」四级。</li>\n<li><strong>延迟处置</strong>是推荐反作弊相对支付风控最大的差异：奖励延迟到资格验证完成，比事后追回便宜一个数量级。</li>\n<li>度量盯分类质量（P/R/F1）、业务代价函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{cost}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 与攻击者绕过成本三组指标；误伤成本高的市场把工作点往保守侧移。</li>\n<li>处置是梯度而非二值；名单必须有生命周期。终局不是抓住所有作弊者，而是让作弊的边际成本高于边际收益——衡量它只需两个数字：被拦下的虚假奖励金额，与被误伤的真实推荐关系数量。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推荐反作弊与风控识别模型","id":"推荐反作弊与风控识别模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：推荐裂变的五类攻击面","id":"核心概念-推荐裂变的五类攻击面"},{"level":2,"text":"信号层：设备、身份、行为、关系四类证据","id":"信号层-设备-身份-行为-关系四类证据"},{"level":2,"text":"从信号到分数：规则、图特征与评分融合","id":"从信号到分数-规则-图特征与评分融合"},{"level":2,"text":"度量：如何判断模型在止损而不是在自嗨","id":"度量-如何判断模型在止损而不是在自嗨"},{"level":2,"text":"处置梯度与名单运营","id":"处置梯度与名单运营"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"奖励运营与申诉异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/reward-ledger-fulfillment-operations/reward-ops-dispute-exception-handling"},"next":{"title":"推荐度量与增量实验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/fraud-abuse-measurement-scale/referral-measurement-incrementality-experiment"}}